 "text": "Hello there! How's life treating you these days? That can be tough with lot of box stuff. Have you tried asking neighbors if they have space you can swap with? Usually short form agreement, and whether you'd rather move now or wait few minutes. Go up the stairs and knock on the door. No problem. Your neighbour will let you in, show them the agreement, and then let them in. Probably, though it means two trips for the box. At the apartment, you can put it straight into the hallway so they don't have to carry it up stairs.",
